@startuml
title SC-ORD-002 — Payment refused: the stock is released
actor Customer as C
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP
participant "Notification" as N

C -> O : PlaceOrder
O --> C : accepted, order PENDING
O ->> I : ReserveStock
I ->> O : StockReserved
O ->> P : ChargePayment
P -> PSP : charge
PSP --> P : declined
P ->> O : PaymentRefused
O ->> I : ReleaseReservation
note over O #FFCDD2 : COMPENSATED\norder REJECTED, PAYMENT_REFUSED
O ->> N : OrderRejected
N ->> C : rejection e-mail
I ->> O : ReservationReleased
note right of O : recorded; the saga\ndid not wait for it
@enduml
